cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If SymLean is useful in your work, please cite the software version you used."
title: "SymLean: A Verified Computer Algebra System in Lean"
abstract: >-
  SymLean is a computer algebra system for Lean 4 and Mathlib. It simplifies expressions, factors
  polynomials, finds roots, differentiates, integrates, takes limits and series, solves linear
  differential equations and proves numerical bounds, and every answer it gives is a theorem that
  Lean's kernel checks, with the conditions under which it holds as hypotheses.
